From d962276ed55c83f0de58818364dc036ac9757e1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:24:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci(flaky_kanban): checkpoint each polled run and stop
 starting runs at a deadline

The ci-flaky-cards cron kills flaky_kanban.py at 600 s and keeps nothing it did:
state was saved only after the whole poll. Two consecutive natural polls on
2026-11-11 (20:30, 20:54 UTC) timed out while GitHub's artifact service was
failing, so each redid and lost the same work. main now saves the state after
every run and stops starting runs after --budget (420 s); unstarted runs stay
unprocessed behind 'FAILED poll_budget deferred=<n>' so the cron stays red and
the next poll resumes there.
---
 scripts/ci/flaky_kanban.py         | 23 +++++++--
 tests/ci/test_flaky_poll_budget.py | 83 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/ci/test_flaky_poll_budget.py

